'''Croconator''' (ワーニネーター, ''Wāninētā'', '''Croconator''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Croco]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Croconator
|image = E 497.png
|first appearance = '''UL:''' [[Lifesaving Shovel|Sub-chapter 21 - Lifesaving Shovel]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Private Beach|Sub-chapter 14 - Private Beach]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
Croconator is unusually weak for an [[Uncanny Legends]] enemy, with lower stats than [[Metal Doge]] in all areas. He only has 5 HP at 100% strength magnification and a mere 500 DPS, making him pose little to no threat on his own. Croconators are sometimes spawned in swarms such as in [[A Boat Too Far]] and [[A Dutiful Prayer]] as roadblocks and/or merely sources of cash.

==Strategy==
Croconators usually aren't a threat, though they may serve as meatshields for stronger enemies, and can survive few hits but shrug off strong hits. Just spam cats with a fast attack rate like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and they'll die rather soon. [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] can sweep a group of Croconators in stages like A Dutiful Prayer. Alternatively, you can use [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]], but you don't have to as long as they aren't too buffed.

