==Trivia==
*The name Croconator is a portmanteau of ''crocodile'' and ''terminator'', as in ''[[wikipedia:The Terminator|The Terminator]]''.
*He is likely a reference to [[wikipedia:Crocodile clip|crocodile clips]], which are made of electricity-conducting metal and so called because of their resemblance to crocodile heads.
*He is the first non-[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy to debut in [[Uncanny Legends]].

